[00:18.14]1. Precious to God, we are daughters and sons,
[00:26.78]Giving our strength as his faithful young ones.
[00:33.79]Loving attention to us he will give,
[00:40.89]Blessing our days for as long as we live.
[01:21.60]2. Honoring parents who care for our lives
[01:28.12]Helps us express what we’re feeling inside.
[01:35.23]Then we find favor with God and with men,
[01:42.33]Drawing us close to Jehovah, our Friend.
[02:15.45]3. May we remember our God in our youth,
[02:21.98]Growing each day in our love of the truth.
[02:26.58]Giving our best to our God, we will bring
[02:33.78]Joy to the heart of Jehovah, our King.